{"h":3396,"lines":[{"h":0.016779640116876937,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.12160301208496094,"y":0.030127621787389591,"x":0.11100919343302773},{"t":"Dancing is also a sociable activity, which is another reason it makes us feel good.","w":0.64827977498372391,"x":0.11310422117508778,"y":0.077002841136019518,"h":0.015560842655572893,"c":1},{"t":"One study compared people's enjoyment of dancing at home in front of a video with dancing","x":0.11516803874761204,"y":0.099776889670134317,"w":0.7305583190917968,"h":0.015076436198923071,"c":1},{"w":0.17743937174479169,"x":0.11086301646856607,"h":0.014193601125261135,"t":"in a group in a studio.","y":0.11525733283556838,"c":1},{"t":"The people dancing in a group reported feeling happier, whereas those dancing alone did not.","c":1,"x":0.11304660454961427,"h":0.018289477300026058,"y":0.13727401034723741,"w":0.73480534871419279},{"w":0.73061538696289063,"x":0.11102405658096567,"y":0.16102933358397864,"h":0.015329595729796419,"t":"In another experiment, university researchers at York and Sheffield took a group of students","c":1},{"w":0.68941324869791676,"h":0.014226168710014364,"c":1,"t":"and sent each of them into a lab where music was played for five minutes. Each had to","y":0.17696083314390743,"x":0.1131111668037092},{"y":0.19163483221326949,"h":0.017234003585977153,"c":1,"t":"choose from three options: to sit and listen quietly to the music, to cycle on an exercise bike","x":0.11306000842965848,"w":0.72653513590494789},{"c":1,"w":0.72427983601888024,"y":0.20784883706083856,"t":"while they listened, or to get up and dance. All were given cognitive tasks to perform before","h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.11111111058768662},{"x":0.11103360320028041,"h":0.016291183633433626,"c":1,"t":"and after. The result showed that those who chose to dance showed much more creativity","y":0.22213772147881528,"w":0.71418869018554687},{"h":0.017089812297843565,"y":0.23778153482899644,"w":0.28227162679036455,"t":"when doing problem-solving tasks.","x":0.1088761115945122,"c":1},{"x":0.11309196478122488,"t":"Doctor Lovatt at the University of Hertfordshire believes dance could be a very useful way to","y":0.26104145164709669,"h":0.016670394421185453,"c":1,"w":0.73060022989908857},{"w":0.73685190836588543,"x":0.10894197693640327,"y":0.27674031055488046,"t":"help people suffering from mental health problems. He thinks dance should be prescribed as","c":1,"h":0.01739188442522277},{"c":1,"y":0.29268667887876643,"h":0.014034139815151891,"x":0.11103337772576177,"t":"therapy to help people overcome issues such as depression.","w":0.48575815836588537},{"t":"Q31","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.88065843660811427,"w":0.034979422887166267,"y":0.22529069751598552},{"y":0.27906976719349275,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.88065843704387403,"t":"Q32","c":1},{"t":"It's well established that dance is a good way of encouraging adolescent girls to take exercise","c":1,"h":0.018138326660623538,"w":0.74506530761718748,"x":0.10894392928358343,"y":0.33817262815692273},{"w":0.69153432210286458,"t":"but what about older people? Studies have shown that there are enormous benefits for","h":0.01601841761450884,"x":0.10896208878064111,"y":0.35362697044571156,"c":1},{"y":0.36893158139096138,"t":"people in their sixties and beyond. One of the great things about dance is that there are no","h":0.016193475262717194,"c":1,"w":0.7182720947265625,"x":0.11102978381832959},{"x":0.11102926641892831,"c":1,"h":0.016358719838100777,"y":0.3844762252942111,"t":"barriers to participation. Anyone can have a go, even those whose standard of fitness is","w":0.69562388102213546},{"t":"quite low.","x":0.10888765082933219,"c":1,"h":0.015477353467817756,"y":0.39923806727562305,"w":0.080578606923421225},{"h":0.013683656640833486,"w":0.66676676432291659,"y":0.42294024446729683,"x":0.11105974354953038,"t":"Dance can be especially beneficial for older adults who can't run or do more intense","c":1},{"t":"workouts, or for those who don't want to. One 2015 study found that even a gentle dance","y":0.43857194766239993,"w":0.70792063395182292,"x":0.10900688049484804,"h":0.015196973218794207,"c":1},{"t":"workout helps to promote a healthy heart. And there's plenty of evidence which suggests that","y":0.45276450668432311,"x":0.11100989436195022,"c":1,"w":0.73888834635416667,"h":0.0171733093486377},{"c":1,"y":0.46703866754745738,"t":"dancing lowers the risk of falls, which could result in a broken hip, for example, by helping","x":0.10883467654725014,"h":0.022079591335480764,"w":0.71235300699869797},{"h":0.014302523874702988,"t":"people to improve their balance.","x":0.11099023033803723,"y":0.48430495257139805,"w":0.25745648701985674,"c":1},{"t":"There are some less obvious benefits of dance for older people too. One thing I hadn't","c":1,"x":0.10895537368333502,"y":0.50722022216349427,"w":0.6874329121907552,"h":0.016755082722406667},{"y":0.52279802263318598,"w":0.71418574015299485,"h":0.016734721944245079,"c":1,"t":"realised before researching this topic was that dance isn't just a physical challenge. It also","x":0.10895735604707303},{"y":0.53796740536677246,"t":"requires a lot of concentration because you need to remember different steps and routines.","w":0.72653269449869795,"x":0.10690875688002478,"h":0.016465627402944771,"c":1},{"w":0.71626759847005217,"h":0.018712375133141501,"c":1,"y":0.5535354834462699,"t":"For older people, this kind of activity is especially important because it forces their brain to","x":0.1068896435400119},{"t":"process things more quickly and to retain more information.","w":0.47554209391276042,"x":0.10688974886070852,"y":0.56902068690069252,"h":0.016785523355077325,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.10896033332104461,"y":0.59222517216545201,"h":0.016500713406799816,"w":0.70182942708333329,"t":"Current research also shows that dance promotes a general sense of well-being in older"},{"y":0.60753181986673355,"w":0.71416722615559891,"c":1,"t":"participants, which can last up to a week after a class. Participants report feeling less tired","x":0.10896426733953944,"h":0.016393358210371578},{"w":0.72865620930989583,"y":0.6217101026805425,"t":"and having greater motivation to be more active and do daily activities such as gardening or","x":0.10892411362630819,"c":1,"h":0.018022728190966952},{"x":0.10905350286031516,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.63953488361142596,"w":0.24485595703124996,"c":1,"t":"walking to the shops or a park."},{"c":1,"h":0.020977903170636192,"y":0.65932314015376703,"w":0.74515940348307297,"x":0.10684692411903465,"t":"Ballroom or country dancing, both popular with older people, have to be done in groups. They"},{"h":0.018594827191428132,"c":1,"t":"require collaboration and often involve touching a dance partner, all of which encourages","x":0.10688177410713479,"y":0.67490962524841114,"w":0.70601908365885424},{"t":"interaction on the dance floor. This helps to develop new relationships and can reduce older","h":0.018597333815971173,"c":1,"x":0.10683729841891003,"w":0.73077356974283858,"y":0.69044038105318661},{"x":0.10684477162434883,"y":0.7064113013549842,"w":0.56822860717773438,"t":"people's sense of isolation, which is a huge problem in many countries.","h":0.018647156278432719,"c":1},{"w":0.72660415649414056,"h":0.017966726503046426,"t":"I also looked at the benefits of Zumba. Fifteen million people in 180 countries now regularly","y":0.7294437417055365,"c":1,"x":0.10481292081002987},{"y":0.74656454577257703,"t":"take a Zumba class, an aerobic workout based on Latin American dance moves. John","x":0.10484985300002715,"h":0.015715711389188924,"c":1,"w":0.68330342610677086},{"c":1,"x":0.10688150221410268,"y":0.76076420551736001,"t":"Porcari, a professor of exercise and sport science at the University of Wisconsin, analysed a","w":0.73274271647135425,"h":0.017348541106998017},{"x":0.10692138788596177,"t":"group of women who were Zumba regulars and found that a class lasting 40 minutes burns","y":0.77671817539115906,"w":0.72238510131835942,"h":0.016037182757374313,"c":1},{"y":0.79179959319261106,"w":0.68950302124023444,"c":1,"x":0.10689369481052126,"t":"about 370 calories. This is similar to moderately intense exercises like step aerobics or","h":0.016867370290947203},{"t":"kickboxing.","x":0.1041224069592508,"y":0.80581972160668514,"h":0.01714470080408248,"w":0.094367993672688791,"c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q33","x":0.87860082365486392,"y":0.3880813952101454,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.48691860449000446,"x":0.87860082365567094,"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q34","c":1},{"x":0.87654320911291295,"c":1,"t":"Q35","y":0.55668604635319485,"w":0.039094651540120484,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"Q36","c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.8765432104861397,"y":0.62645348821606461},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q37","y":0.69476744214103958,"h":0.013081394460653373,"x":0.87654321078872988,"c":1},{"x":0.87654321026423565,"y":0.78052325565792502,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Q38","w":0.034979422887166378},{"t":"108","x":0.10493827220848302,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186213,"y":0.90116279053924131},{"w":0.25427068074544268,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.027081890577983492,"x":0.71952531067331094,"y":0.95559854902539954,"c":1}],"w":2400}